## .dockerignore for LMSApi Docker build
## Context root: LMSApi/

# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestReport/

# Local secrets / dev config
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/.user
**/*.user

# Logs
**/logs/

# IDE files
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/*.suo
**/*.DS_Store

# Git
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
